scp933-duct-tape = Duct Tape
scp933-duct-tape-desc = A roll of silver duct tape. Sticky and versatile.
scp933-master-desc = The first host of the tape. What was a face is only silver edges now.

scp933-tape-mask = SCP-933 face tape
scp933-tape-mask-desc = Silver strips pressed over the eyes. It does not breathe with you.

scp933-victim-face-torn = The tape rips away — your face is gone and your voice with it. You are still yourself; only the mask is gone.
scp933-host-emerged = The tape falls away. What is left hungers.

scp933-self-taped = You tear a strip from the roll and seal your own face.
scp933-victim-stabilized = The tape binds tighter; their body steadies under your hands.
scp933-self-already-mask = You already have tape on your face.
scp933-self-equip-fail = You could not keep the tape on your face.
scp933-tape-master-only = Only the tape-bearer can use the duct tape like this.
scp933-tape-already = Their face is already sealed with tape.
scp933-tape-already-faceless = Their face is already gone; more tape will not stick there.
scp933-tape-no-other-master = You cannot tape another bearer of the tape.
scp933-tape-equip-fail = The tape would not stick there.
scp933-tape-applied-master = You tear a strip from the roll and press it over their face.
scp933-tape-applied-victim = Cold tape seals your face.
scp933-tape-ripped-master = You tear the tape free. What is left has no face.